From d5c024894f32a08db1d23a22890d297ab2a2931c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Mar 2026 10:19:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix iOS app: cropping, navigation, API timeouts, and safe
 area layout

- ImageCropper: Fix PanResponder stale closure by syncing cropBox/imageLayout
  via refs so gesture handlers always read current values
- ImageCropper: Use useSafeAreaInsets() for header and bottom actions instead
  of hardcoded paddingTop:60 / paddingBottom:40 that overlapped iPhone notch
- ImageCropper: Clamp crop region to image bounds to prevent manipulateAsync errors
- add-from-screenshot: Await analyzeImages() in handleCrop to surface errors
- add-from-screenshot: Fix saveAsDraft to use cropped image when available
- add-from-screenshot: Reset originalFileUri and showCropper in reset()
- _layout.tsx: Register missing listing-builder route (navigation was failing)
- api.ts: Add 15s AbortController timeout so requests don't hang forever

https://claude.ai/code/session_01XxLr5Mds7Kgk7vCSC34Rnf
